B.Mj=new A.y("Forest Gate","Kiko invites you into the forest. Many friends are waiting!","Greet friends with a smile \u2014 and everyone feels happy.",B.r)
B.Po=new A.y("Murky Lake","This lake is full of plastic trash. The fish look sad.","Clean water keeps fish healthy. Never throw trash in the water!",B.F)
B.OC=new A.y("Butterfly Flowers","The butterflies are gone. The flowers here are wilting and need care.","Do not pick flowers carelessly \u2014 let them grow for the butterflies.",B.r)
B.Pw=new A.y("Little Mushroom","Mushrooms grow on the old tree. Every creature has its place.","Even small things matter \u2014 respect every living thing.",B.r)
B.N_=new A.y("Trash on the Path","The little path is full of candy wrappers. Let us clean it up!","Put trash in the bin, wherever you are.",B.F)
B.P3=new A.y("Banyan Tree","The banyan tree is very old, a home for many birds.","Respect the old \u2014 trees, grandparents, and teachers too.",B.U)
B.P2=new A.y("Lost Rabbit","A rabbit ran deep into the forest. Let us look for it slowly.","Help a friend who is lost \u2014 that is a kind heart.",B.r)
B.N7=new A.y("Thirsty Deer","The deer is looking for clean water. Help Kiko protect the spring.","A clean spring keeps every creature healthy.",B.F)
B.Pi=new A.y("Fruit Garden","The fruit trees bear fruit, but it all fell and was forgotten.","Take just enough, and leave some for others.",B.r)
B.Qr=new A.y("The Owl","The owl guards the forest at night. It calls hoo hoo hoo!","Every creature has a job \u2014 even the ones awake at night.",B.r)
B.Q4=new A.y("Plastic Trash","Lots of plastic is stuck on the branches. Animals can get trapped!","Plastic does not rot \u2014 sort it, never throw it carelessly.",B.F)
B.Nm=new A.y("Squirrel Leaps","Squirrels leap from tree to tree. They need many whole trees.","Do not break the branches \u2014 they are paths for them.",B.r)
B.Q0=new A.y("Baby Deer","A baby deer lost its mother. Help find her!","A child needs a parent, and a parent needs a loving child.",B.r)
B.MS=new A.y("Dripping Cave","In the cave are lovely stone drips. Look, but do not touch.","Rare and precious things \u2014 admire them, do not break them.",B.L)
B.Ng=new A.y("Honey Bees","The bees work hard to gather honey. Let us watch from far away.","Hard workers deserve respect. Do not disturb their work.",B.U)
B.Mu=new A.y("Rippling River","The river flows clean again. The fish are back to play!","See the result? Small work each day makes a healthy forest.",B.F)
B.NF=new A.y("Young Sprout","A new tree sprout starts to grow. One day it will be a big tree.","Small today can be big later. Be patient and caring.",B.r)
B.M2=new A.y("Bird's Nest","A nest sits on a high branch. Look from afar, do not climb up.","Respect other homes \u2014 even a bird's home.",B.U)
B.PN=new A.y("Sun Bear","A sun bear walks by. Give it room, do not shout!","Calm and humble \u2014 that is polite, in the forest and at home.",B.U)
B.LP=new A.y("Rainforest","Rain falls. The leaves get a bath and the forest feels fresh.","Rain is a gift from the sky. Be thankful and use it well.",B.r)
B.PP=new A.y("Caterpillar Changes","The caterpillar goes into its cocoon. Soon it will be a butterfly!","Be patient \u2014 good things need time to grow.",B.r)
B.Oy=new A.y("Forest Ranger","The forest ranger arrives. He guards the forest every day.","Respect those who protect nature \u2014 rangers, teachers, grandparents.",B.U)
B.M6=new A.y("Trash in Three","The ranger teaches sorting trash: organic, plastic, hazardous.","Sort your trash from now on \u2014 your home stays clean.",B.F)
B.Oz=new A.y("Blooming Forest","The flowers bloom again. The butterflies are back!","See? The forest blooms because you cared.",B.r)
B.NS=new A.y("Forest Party","All the animals gather. They want to say thank you.",'Thanking each other is lovely. Try saying "thank you" today.',B.r)
B.Oc=new A.y("Forest Forever","The last day in Kiko's Forest! The final boss awaits.","You are a Forest Keeper now! Bring this good habit into real life.",B.F)
B.a2f=new A.bm([1,B.Mj,2,B.Po,3,B.OC,4,B.Pw,5,B.N_,6,B.P3,7,B.P2,8,B.N7,9,B.Pi,10,B.Qr,11,B.Q4,12,B.Nm,13,B.Q0,14,B.MS,15,B.Ng,16,B.Mu,17,B.NF,18,B.M2,19,B.PN,20,B.LP,21,B.PP,22,B.Oy,23,B.M6,24,B.Oz,25,B.NS,26,B.Oc],t._4)
B.PB=new A.y("Morning Beach","The sun rises. Kiko invites you for a walk on the beach!","A good morning starts with a cheerful heart.",B.r)
B.Od=new A.y("Trash in the Sand","Plastic bottles are scattered everywhere. The beach is dirty.","Take your trash home \u2014 or use the beach bin.",B.F)
B.Mf=new A.y("Pretty Shells","Colorful shells wash ashore. Look, but leave them there.","Keep the memory with your eyes, and leave nature as it is.",B.L)
B.Q6=new A.y("Running Crab","A little crab runs to the sea. Give it room!","Make way for the smaller and weaker.",B.r)
B.M7=new A.y("Turtle Eggs","A turtle lays eggs in the sand. They need a safe spot.","Turtle eggs are rare \u2014 protect them, do not take them.",B.r)
B.O_=new A.y("Reef Fish","A clownfish hides in the anemone. So beautiful!","Every sea creature has its home \u2014 respect it.",B.U)
B.Nw=new A.y("Bottles at Sea","Many bottles float by. Sea animals might swallow them by mistake.","Plastic in the sea is dangerous for fish and whales.",B.F)
B.M4=new A.y("Pretty Coral","Colorful coral lies below. Thousands of fish live there.","Broken coral takes hundreds of years to grow back \u2014 protect it!",B.F)
B.NA=new A.y("Old Turtle","An old turtle comes by. It has traveled all the oceans!","The old have many stories \u2014 listen carefully.",B.U)
B.Ov=new A.y("Baby Turtles","Tiny baby turtles hatch. They must reach the sea.","Do not block them \u2014 let them go home.",B.r)
B.OZ=new A.y("Fisherman Pak Eko","Pak Eko is an old fisherman. He tells of the sea long ago.","Respect elders and those who work hard for their family.",B.U)
B.Pq=new A.y("Fish Market","At the fish market, everyone is honest about prices. Kiko learns.","Honest trade makes buyers trust you.",B.au)
B.Pk=new A.y("Dolphins","Dolphins leap in the sea! They are very smart.","Smart and still kind \u2014 that is true smart.",B.r)
B.O1=new A.y("Net in the Sand","A fisherman's net lies on the sand, with a crab trapped in it.","Help the trapped \u2014 a small kindness that means a lot.",B.r)
