B.Pb=new A.y("Mangrove Forest","The mangroves protect the beach from waves. The trees are strong!",u.N,B.r)
B.LT=new A.y("Glass Bottle","A broken glass bottle is in the sand. It can hurt passing feet.","Pick up the dangerous \u2014 help others stay safe.",B.F)
B.MC=new A.y("Jellyfish","A jellyfish floats near the shore. Look, but do not touch.","The pretty can sometimes be dangerous \u2014 be careful.",B.L)
