B.Nb=new A.y("Whale Passes","A big whale passes in the distance. So amazing!","The big is not always scary \u2014 it is just passing by.",B.r)
B.M_=new A.y("Clean Beach","Kiko invites friends to pick up trash together. A cleaner beach!","Cleanliness is a shared job \u2014 invite your friends.",B.F)
B.PS=new A.y("Lighthouse","The lighthouse shines every night, guiding ships home safely.","Be like a lighthouse \u2014 give light to others.",B.r)
B.ND=new A.y("Heading Home","Evening comes. The fishermen return with fish for their families.","Today's hard work makes the family happy.",B.r)
B.N6=new A.y("Turtles Return","The baby turtle from before is big now! It returns to the beach.","What you protect will come back to say thank you.",B.r)
